<title>HONG KONG: Kerry Prop announces 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Kerry Prop announces 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   128.41</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    30.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    1,182.31</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,005.95</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kerry Properties Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  March 24-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 1</p>
<p>NOTE - Kerry Properties, a unit of Malaysian tycoon Robert Kuok controlled Kuok Group, was listed on the Stock Exchange on August 5, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
